sequenceDiagram
    participant Component as UI Component / Feature
    participant Hook as React Query Hook
    participant ApiMethod as Entity API Method
    participant AuthClient as authClient
    participant HttpClient as HttpClient
    participant Backend as Backend API

    Component->>Hook: Calls query or mutation
    Hook->>ApiMethod: Executes API method
    ApiMethod->>AuthClient: Sends protected request
    AuthClient->>HttpClient: Performs HTTP request
    HttpClient->>Backend: fetch(...)
    Backend-->>HttpClient: JSON response
    HttpClient-->>AuthClient: Parsed response
    AuthClient-->>ApiMethod: Result
    ApiMethod-->>Hook: Data
    Hook-->>Component: Loading / error / data state
